{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "de",
  "language_raw": "German",
  "source": "message/dat/German/script/sdc02_0080.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/German/script/sdc02_0080.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EE58D31F07F68497",
      "text": "Und, konntest du ein Pokémon in der Alola-Form\\nfangen?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EE58D41F07F6864A",
      "text": "Dann such noch ein bisschen weiter. Stell dir\\neinfach vor, du wärst gerade in Alola!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EE58D51F07F687FD",
      "text": "Tut mir leid, aber das ist keine Alola-Form.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "EE58CE1F07F67C18",
      "text": "Oooh! Da gibt es keinen Zweifel! Das ist ganz\\nklar die Alola-Form von [VAR 0x0101(0001)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "EE58CF1F07F67DCB",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon sammelt Psycho-Kräfte in\\nseinem Schweif und bewegt sich wie ein Surfer\\r\\nauf ihm fort.\\c\\nDaher wird es auch „Geländesurfer“ genannt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EE58D01F07F67F7E",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon kommuniziert mit Artgenossen,\\nindem es mit den metallischen Haaren wackelt,\\r\\ndie aus seinem Kopf wachsen.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EE58D11F07F68131",
      "text": "Die golden leuchtenden Haare dieses Pokémon\\ndienen ihm als sensible Sensoren.\\c\\nMit ihnen kann es Geräusche in mehreren\\nKilometern Entfernung wahrnehmen!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EE58CA1F07F6754C",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon ist launenhaft und selbstsüchtig,\\naber manche Trainer geben ihm nur zu gerne die\\r\\nAufmerksamkeit, nach der es sich sehnt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EE58CB1F07F676FF",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon verfügt über enorme\\nphysische Stärke.\\c\\nAufgrund seines runden Gesichts und weichen\\nFells erfreut es sich in Alola großer Beliebtheit.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EE5C581F07F99C6D",
      "text": "Sleima wurden damals nach Alola gebracht,\\num die dortige Abfallproblematik zu lösen.\\r\\nMit der Zeit nahmen sie dann diese Form an.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EE5C571F07F99ABA",
      "text": "Was nach Fangzähnen und Krallen aussieht,\\nsind in Wirklichkeit kristalline Giftstoffe.\\c\\nDie bloße Berührung führt bereits zur Vergiftung,\\ndaher sollte man sich ihm nur vorsichtig nähern!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "EE5C561F07F99907",
      "text": "Der Wachstumsschub dieses Pokémon machte\\nseine Psycho-Kräfte überflüssig.\\c\\nStattdessen wurden die in ihm schlummernden\\nDrachen-Kräfte geweckt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EE5C551F07F99754",
      "text": "Der eisige Atem dieses Pokémon beträgt −50 ℃.\\nManche nennen es auch „Ke’oke’o“, was sein\\r\\nfrüherer Name ist.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EE5C541F07F995A1",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon kann mit seinem Fell Eiskristalle\\nerzeugen und lebt auf Bergen, die stets von\\r\\nSchnee bedeckt sind.\\c\\nFrüher wurde es sogar als Gottheit verehrt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EE5C531F07F993EE",
      "text": "Da es in durch Schnee abgeschotteten\\nBergregionen lebt, hat es sich einen\\r\\nstahlharten Körper aus Eis angeeignet.\\c\\nSein Bauch ist allerdings weich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EE5C521F07F9923B",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon hat große und scharfe Krallen\\nentwickelt, damit es sich leichter durch Schnee\\r\\ngraben und so über Schneefelder rasen kann.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EE5C511F07F99088",
      "text": "Der Steinkörper dieses Pokémon ist von\\nMagnetkraft erfüllt.\\c\\nAn den Stellen, wo diese besonders stark wirkt,\\nheften sich Schichten von Eisensand an.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "EE5C501F07F98ED5",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon ist sehr streitlustig.\\nDurch die Gesteinsart, von der es sich ernährt,\\r\\nist sein gesamter Körper von Elektrizität erfüllt.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "EE5C4F1F07F98D22",
      "text": "Dieses Pokémon ist dickköpfig und mürrisch.\\nWenn man es verärgert, stößt es Strom aus und\\r\\nheult mit donnernder Stimme auf.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "CE97A87B27A6F75A",
      "text": "Was?! Du hast die Aufgabe schon erledigt?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "49B42BEA169DA8EB",
      "text": "Ich hab mich ins Zeug gelegt!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "49B42CEA169DAA9E",
      "text": "Das war doch ein Klacks!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "CE97A77B27A6F5A7",
      "text": "Dann stellst du dich also nicht nur im Kämpfen,\\nsondern auch im Fangen geschickt an...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "CE97A67B27A6F3F4",
      "text": "Da zeigt sich der hohe Standard der\\nOrangen-Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "CE97A57B27A6F241",
      "text": "Da zeigt sich der hohe Standard der\\nTrauben-Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "EE5FBE1F07FC7F96",
      "text": "Also gut, kommt bitte alle mal her!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "EE5FBF1F07FC8149",
      "text": "Für heute ist die Zeit um und der Unterricht\\ndamit beendet!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "EE5FBC1F07FC7C30",
      "text": "Wem es noch nicht gelungen ist, ein Pokémon\\nzu fangen, der macht das bitte als Hausaufgabe.\\r\\nBis zum nächsten Mal!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_mob_01",
      "hash64": "9A95444F99F3B847",
      "text": "Och nööö... Jetzt hab ich auch noch\\nHausaufgaben...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "CE97A47B27A6F08E",
      "text": "Und? Wie fandest du deinen ersten Unterricht\\nbei uns?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_03",
      "hash64": "49B42DEA169DAC51",
      "text": "Er hat Spaß gemacht!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_04",
      "hash64": "49B42EEA169DAE04",
      "text": "Er war total einfach!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "CE97A37B27A6EEDB",
      "text": "Wirklich? Oooh, da bin ich erleichtert![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "CE97A27B27A6ED28",
      "text": "Wirklich?! Du bist von deiner Akademie wohl\\nschwierigere Kurse gewohnt...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "CE97A17B27A6EB75",
      "text": "Oh, fast vergessen! Ich muss noch im AG-Raum\\nvorbeischauen![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "CE97A07B27A6E9C2",
      "text": "Damit ist meine Führung dann wohl zu Ende.\\nAber eine nützliche Info hab ich noch...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "CE94237B27A3DF84",
      "text": "Hier an der Akademie kann man nach dem\\nUnterricht [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Blaubeer-Missionen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] – oder einfach\\r\\nkurz [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Missionen[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] – erledigen.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "CE94207B27A3DA6B",
      "text": "Diese Aufgaben werden von der Akademie\\ngestellt und finden innerhalb der Kuppel statt.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
